# CR 510.4: the regular combat damage step is for the attackers and blockers "that had neither first strike nor double
# strike as the first combat damage step began", whatever they have now. Bot1 attacks with Thalia, Guardian of Thraben
# (first strike) and Llanowar Elves (1/1). After Thalia's first-strike damage (Bot2 to 18), Bot1 casts Violent Urge on the
# Elves ({1} more for Thalia): +1/+0 and first strike. The Elves had no first strike as the first step began, so they deal
# their 2 in the regular step (Bot2 to 16); Thalia, which had first strike and has no double strike, deals no more.

